# T3Lab Assistant runtime-generated data — machine-local, regenerated on
# first use, and previously leaked developer machine paths/conversation
# content into the repo. See T3Lab.extension/lib/Services/tool_discovery.py
# and Intelligence/t3lab_assistant.py — both handle a missing file gracefully.
# These now live in %APPDATA%\T3LabAI (core.paths.user_data_path); the old
# in-extension copies are only read once as a legacy source.
T3Lab.extension/lib/config/tool_registry.json
T3Lab.extension/lib/config/chat_history/
T3Lab.extension/lib/Intelligence/config/learned_patterns.json
T3Lab.extension/lib/Intelligence/config/assistant_feedback.json
T3Lab.extension/lib/Intelligence/config/assistant_memory.json
T3Lab.extension/lib/GUI/join_rules.json
**/IFC-SG.pushbutton/reports/
# Older builds saved imported configs here. To ship a config with the tool,
# add it with `git add -f`.
**/IFC-SG.pushbutton/configs/

# Local fine-tune build artifacts (finetune_local.py default --out)
tools/train/out/

# Model Auditor score history is per-user project data: it lives in
# %APPDATA%\T3LabAI\model_auditor\history. The old in-extension folder must
# never be committed again (it exposed client project names, 2026-10-02).
T3Lab.extension/lib/GUI/Resources/ModelAuditorHistory/

# Per-user tool state lives in %APPDATA%\T3LabAI (core.paths.user_data_path).
# Legacy copies that older builds wrote next to the scripts must not be
# committed again.
**/dqt_bg_config.json
**/dqt_ribbon_*.json
**/.ribbon-*.tmp

# Visual Studio workspace / Copilot index caches
.vs/
# Personal Claude Code permissions (machine paths) — keep local, never commit
.claude/settings.local.json
